<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi industrial exports up at $6.1 bln in 1995.</title>
<headline>Saudi industrial exports up at $6.1 bln in 1995.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The value of Saudi Arabia's industrial exports grew to more than 23 billion riyals ($6.1 billion) in 1995 from around 607 million riyals in 1985, the industry minister said in remarks published on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;Exports from national industries, including petrochemicals, stood at more than 23 billion riyals (in 1995),&quot; Industry and Electricity Minister Hashem bin Abdullah bin Hashem Yamani told the Saudi newspaper al-Yaum.</p>
<p>($1=3.75 riyals)</p>
</text>
